# HTTP Clients with RestClient

## Overview

This BFF uses **Declarative HTTP Interfaces** with RestClient for type-safe, clean backend API calls. Virtual threads are enabled for optimal blocking I/O performance.

## Declarative HTTP Interface Pattern (Preferred)

### Define Client Interface (in `infrastructure/client/{backend}/`)

```java
/**
 * Declarative HTTP client for eModal API.
 * 
 * JWT token is passed via X-EModal-Token header, automatically propagated 
 * by TokenPropagationInterceptor as a Bearer token.
 */
public interface EModalClient {
    
    @GetExchange("/datahub/fee/containerfeeinventory/{containerNumber}/{tradeType}")
    List<EModalContainerFeeInventoryDto> getContainerFeeInventory(
        @PathVariable String containerNumber,
        @PathVariable String tradeType
    );
    
    @GetExchange("/datahub/fee/containerfeeinventory/{id}")
    JsonNode getContainerFeeDetails(@PathVariable String id);
}

public interface CargoSprintClient {
    
    @GetExchange("/api/containers/{containerNumber}")
    CargoSprintContainerDto getContainer(@PathVariable String containerNumber);
    
    @PostExchange("/api/containers/search")
    List<CargoSprintContainerDto> searchContainers(@RequestBody SearchRequest request);
}
```

### Backend DTOs (in `infrastructure/client/{backend}/dto/`)

```java
public record EModalContainerFeeInventoryDto(
    String drayUnitId,
    String containerNumber,
    String status,
    String terminalCode,
    String steamshipLine,
    EModalLfdInfoDto lfdInfo
) {}

public record EModalLfdInfoDto(
    LocalDateTime lastFreeDay,
    String lfdStatus
) {}

public record CargoSprintContainerDto(
    String containerNumber,
    String status,
    String location
) {}
```

## HTTP Interface Configuration

### HttpInterfaceConfig (in `infrastructure/config/`)

```java
@Configuration
public class HttpInterfaceConfig {
    
    @Bean
    public EModalClient eModalClient(RestClient eModalRestClient) {
        return createClient(eModalRestClient, EModalClient.class);
    }
    
    @Bean
    public CargoSprintClient cargoSprintClient(RestClient cargoSprintRestClient) {
        return createClient(cargoSprintRestClient, CargoSprintClient.class);
    }
    
    private <T> T createClient(RestClient restClient, Class<T> clientClass) {
        var factory = HttpServiceProxyFactory
            .builderFor(RestClientAdapter.create(restClient))
            .build();
        
        return factory.createClient(clientClass);
    }
}
```

### RestClient Configuration (in `infrastructure/config/`)

```java
@Configuration
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class HttpClientConfig {
    
    private final BackendProperties backendProperties;
    private final TokenPropagationInterceptor tokenInterceptor;
    private final CorrelationIdInterceptor correlationIdInterceptor;
    private final HttpLoggingInterceptor loggingInterceptor;
    
    @Bean
    public RestClient eModalRestClient(RestClient.Builder builder) {
        return builder
            .baseUrl(backendProperties.getEmodal().getUrl())
            .requestInterceptor(tokenInterceptor)
            .requestInterceptor(correlationIdInterceptor)
            .requestInterceptor(loggingInterceptor)
            .defaultHeader(HttpHeaders.ACCEPT, MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON_VALUE)
            .build();
    }
    
    @Bean
    public RestClient cargoSprintRestClient(RestClient.Builder builder) {
        return builder
            .baseUrl(backendProperties.getCargosprint().getUrl())
            .requestInterceptor(tokenInterceptor)
            .requestInterceptor(correlationIdInterceptor)
            .requestInterceptor(loggingInterceptor)
            .defaultHeader(HttpHeaders.ACCEPT, MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON_VALUE)
            .build();
    }
}
```

